; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM.c	  2350           1. NvM isn't processing any block yet or any more (not started or nearly done NvM_WriteAll)
; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM.c	  2351           2. NvM is processing a block and shall abort directly before or after passing the block to underlying modules
