; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM.c	  2360   \REASON NvM supports three API configuration classes: 3 includes all functionality, 2 removes some functionality and 1 is the smallest
; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM.c	  2361           NvM functionality with only multi block requests. Because of the missing functionalities it is not possible to cover all
